      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would fit better in the IK 2.0 Beta feedback board. I posted this https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-ik-20/p/11784-respect-steamvr-tracker-roles about respecting tracker roles. Though, another app might not like a tracker being set as disabled. so the ability to separate trackers independently of their role/position may still be useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
