  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-21T10:40:05.028Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now there is no way to tell VRChat to ignore certain trackers. Users might want to put trackers on their headsets or on other tracked objects however, without these additional trackers confusing the game into thinking they're used for Full Body Tracking.\nMy suggestion would be the addition of a new repeatable launch parameter --ignore-device=<sn> that takes the serial number of the tracker or controller that is supposed to be ignored and then simply not acknowledging that devices existence.",
